name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-postassessment-q8_2026-pilot'

question 'Which of the following recommendations for sharing information with AI tools reflects the BEST understanding of data privacy?'

right 'Before sharing any information with an AI tool, ask yourself whether you would be comfortable if that information were made public or used in ways you didn\'t intend.'
wrong 'Only share information you wouldn\'t mind your parents seeing, since they have access to all your accounts.'
wrong 'It is always safe to share information with AI tools owned by large, reputable companies.'
wrong 'The safest approach is to never use any AI tool that requires you to type anything.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

